 sind dann, da muss man, da muss man filmiert gucken, die sind nicht für jeden gut verträglich. Das bedeutet, dass sie häufiger in die Praxis kommen müssen, als sie das gewohnt sind. Auf der anderen Seite viele Patienten vertragen ja auch gut, ohne dass Nebenwirkung auftreten.", "granularity": "word", "items": [{"text": " Und", "start_seconds": 225.76, "end_seconds": 226.0, "confidence": null}, {"text": "die", "start_seconds": 226.0, "end_seconds": 226.32, "confidence": null}, {"text": "sind", "start_seconds": 226.32, "end_seconds": 226.48, "confidence": null}, {"text": "dann,", "start_seconds": 226.48, "end_seconds": 226.56, "confidence": null}, {"text": "da", "start_seconds": 227.12, "end_seconds": 227.28, "confidence": null}, {"text": "muss", "start_seconds": 227.28, "end_seconds": 227.36, "confidence": null}, {"text": "man,", "start_seconds": 227.36, "end_seconds": 227.44, "confidence": null}, {"text": "da", "start_seconds": 228.0, "end_seconds": 228.08, "confidence": null}, {"text": "muss", "start_seconds": 228.08, "end_seconds": 228.16, "confidence": null}, {"text": "man", "start_seconds": 228.16, "end_seconds": 228.24, "confidence": null}, {"text": "filmiert", "start_seconds": 228.56, "end_seconds": 228.8, "confidence": null}, {"text": "gucken,", "start_seconds": 228.8, "end_seconds": 228.88, "confidence": null}, {"text": "die", "start_seconds": 229.28, "end_seconds": 229.44, "confidence": null}, {"text": "sind", "start_seconds": 229.44, "end_seconds": 229.52, "confidence": null}, {"text": "nicht", "start_seconds": 229.52, "end_seconds": 229.68, "confidence": null}, {"text": "für", "start_seconds": 229.68, "end_seconds": 229.84, "confidence": null}, {"text": "jeden", "start_seconds": 229.84, "end_seconds": 230.16, "confidence": null}, {"text": "gut", "start_seconds": 230.16, "end_seconds": 230.32, "confidence": null}, {"text": "verträglich.", "start_seconds": 230.32, "end_seconds": 230.56, "confidence": null}, {"text": "Das", "start_seconds": 231.44, "end_sec