agen", "start_seconds": 298.16, "end_seconds": 298.64, "confidence": null}, {"text": "und", "start_seconds": 298.64, "end_seconds": 298.8, "confidence": null}, {"text": "darum", "start_seconds": 298.8, "end_seconds": 298.96, "confidence": null}, {"text": "nein,", "start_seconds": 299.6, "end_seconds": 299.92, "confidence": null}, {"text": "das", "start_seconds": 299.92, "end_seconds": 300.0, "confidence": null}, {"text": "heißt", "start_seconds": 300.0, "end_seconds": 300.24, "confidence": null}, {"text": "nicht,", "start_seconds": 300.24, "end_seconds": 300.48, "confidence": null}, {"text": "dass", "start_seconds": 300.48, "end_seconds": 300.8, "confidence": null}, {"text": "sie", "start_seconds": 300.8, "end_seconds": 300.88, "confidence": null}]}, {"type": "transcript.final", "session_id": "64720822-5806-49b5-a223-5bb3215d0e3e", "sequence": 400, "segment_id": 42, "revision": 24, "text": " berufenfähig werden, sondern es heißt, dass für sie ein Risiko besteht. Deswegen Berufen fähig zu werden. Es gibt Sportlehrerinnen, die Räume kriegen und trotzdem ist zur Rente arbeiten können. Ihre Medikamente gut vertragen und wo es nicht so gelenkt zerstörungen kommt", "granularity": "word", "items": [{"text": " berufenfähig", "start_seconds": 301.84, "end_seconds": 302.56, "confidence": null}, {"text": "werden,", "start_seconds": 302.56, "end_seconds": 302.88, "confidence": null}, {"text": "sondern", "start_seconds": 302.88, "end_seconds": 303.12, "confidence": null}, {"text": "es", "start_seconds": 303.12, "end_seconds": 303.28, "confidence": null}, {"text": "heißt,", "start_seconds": 303.28, "end_seconds": 303.44, "confidence": null}, {"text": "dass", "start_seconds": 303.44, "end_seconds": 303.6, "confidence": null}, {"text": "für", "start_seconds": 303.6, "end_seconds": 303.76, "confidence": null}, {"text": "sie", "start_seconds": 303.76, "end_seconds": 303.84, "confidence": null}, {"text": "ein", "start_seconds": 303.84, "end_seconds": 304.08, "confidence": null}, {"tex